  unitName: "Warlord Coal Cauldron (EU, 6\u2605)"
  unitId: 710155
  unitNumber: 7085
  description: "After burning the residents of Bloody Blink\u2019s city thanks to
    his brother in arms Pig Bull, Coal Cauldron distributed the city\u2019s Techs
    to his allies... after helping himself. Now Warlord of the region with his friend
    Pig Bull, he rules with an iron wheel, undefeated by the survivors under his
    yoke."
  summonDesc: I will roll over the ashes of our enemies!
  fusionDesc: On the road again!
  evoDesc: Thanks to Techs, my flames are more powerful than ever.
